Package: fluorine-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: hyprland, hypridle, hyprlock, waybar, kitty, fuzzel,
 sway-notification-center, swaybg, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, jq,
 libnotify-bin
Description: FluorineOS AMOLED Hyprland desktop environment
 FluorineOS desktop configuration for Hyprland 0.55 and later, built on a
 pure AMOLED black base with a reactive lime accent.
 .
 The package installs the native Lua compositor configuration, Waybar,
 Kitty, Fuzzel, and SwayNotificationCenter themes, hypridle and hyprlock
 OLED burn-in protection, and the flr-shot, flr-keys, and flr-doctor
 command line utilities.
 .
 Configuration is installed into /etc/skel/.config so that newly created
 users receive the FluorineOS desktop on first login.
